SUMMARY:Painting Cards for Mother's Day
DESCRIPTION:THIS Saturday\, May 2nd\, we’ll create some beautiful cards for Mother’s Day (or spring & summer birthdays).\nWe’ll have fun in this free-flowing workshop\, painting\, drawing\, and collaging half a dozen cards with the themes of HEARTS & FLOWERS.\nIt’s also an opportunity to gather\, connect\, and meet your local like-minded neighbors and start a routine of coming together\, forming an art community with repeated gatherings.\nSaturday\, May 2nd\, 1-3:00 PM\n$35\, all supplies provided\nBYOB drinks & snacks\, kitchen on site\nFull Circle Studio\, 360 Tesconi Circle\, Suite C\, Santa Rosa.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/painting-cards-for-mothers-day/
LOCATION:Full Circle Studio\, 360 Tesconi Circle\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Art,Holiday
