SUMMARY:Neon Lotus at Rio Nido Roadhouse
DESCRIPTION:Neon Lotus is the creative partnership of Sonoma County musicians David Gray and Kristina Ibarra\, joined by top-notch musicians such as Jordan Lydon\, Miles McKenzie\, and Spencer Burrows. The band was formed in 2023 with the mission of capturing an eclectic variety of sounds drawing from their influences of jazz\, RnB\, funk\, rock\, and more. Their main body of work includes covers of classic and modern tunes reimagined in a fresh and original style. \n  \nUnwind Wednesday features drinks specials and small bites. \n 
